        "line": 261,
        "text": "theorem pressure_scaling {Q Qr K Kr : ℝ} (hQ : 0 < Q) (hQr : 0 < Qr)\n    (hK : K ≠ 0) (hKr : Kr ≠ 0) (h : ℝ) :\n    (clockWeight h Q Qr * velocityWeight h Q Qr / normalWeight Q Qr K Kr) * (Kr / K) =\n      pressureWeight h Q Qr"
